  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "At the Atari landfill excavation, Evil Totto escapes and flies off to conquer the world, and get ahold of the golden pineapple. Along the way, he recruits a bunch of evil bastards to join him with his evil plans. It´s now up to you, Pinky, the brave and cool flamingo, to stop Evil Totto and his evil friends, and find the golden pineapple, and once and for all put him back in the ground. Along the way, you will need to collect as many pineapples as you can to gain the strength (extralives) to take him down."
    }
  ],
